("sleeptrain-1vlippi",None,P,"baby_5_8_months","failure_story",["ferber","retraining_after_setback","nap_transition"],"We successfully did the Ferber method a couple of months ago, and she had been sleeping through the night pretty consistently since. However the past little while her night sleep has gotten a lot worse.","Almost 8 months; worse since moving to two naps."),
